{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしまりお)です☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "昨日ぶりですね\n今日も読みに来てくれてありがとうございます🙇🏻‍♀️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はね、タイミング逃して載せれていなかった写真達を共有ෆ˚*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タイトルからお察しの通り\nあれですよ。\nあれ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さん、先週の乃木坂工事中は観てくださいましたか？👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "観てない方は是非\n多分笑顔になれます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/YvegEOGjjqA?si=cyKwbe-vb3XeDKfk"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "沢山の先輩方が余興をする中"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私はミャクミャクになったんです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "え？どゆこと？\nと思ったそこの貴方。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こういう事です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "BEFORE"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob5SHI9h.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "AFTER"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mobmU58zO.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "へ〜んし〜ん〜🧙‍♂️✨ｷﾗｷﾗ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日は人生初が盛りだくさんでした✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めて余興に出れて\n初めてミャクミャクになって\n初めて顔を青くして､､､"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "めちゃくちゃ楽しかったです✌︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202602/mob5raJBp.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "美少年の御三方"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あまりのカッコ良さ、というか美しさに6期生メンバーはずっと黄色い声を挙げておりました🤫"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ミャクミャクになれたことも勿論、\n乃木坂工事中の余興に出れたことが何より嬉しかったし、幸せでしたෆ˚*"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして私は乃木坂工事中のテロップが大好きなので"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢ライスほしぃ〜の♡｣\n｢本当は低山｣\n｢爆笑ENDOレス。｣とかとか､､､"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつか自分の名前にちなんだテロップを作っていただけないかな〜なんて贅沢な夢も抱いていたのですが、\n叶いました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢ナガシミャクミャク。｣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最高です。\n今日のタイトルにしよう。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ではでは\nまた書くね☺︎"}], "source": "official"}